{"asset_key":"ep4/gameplay_story_14601270","episode":"ep4","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"14601270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1460127001:0":{"text":"当初、貴殿の剣技は、すでに極みの域に達していたと思ったが……","source_cn":"我原本以为当年见面时，你的剑法已经登峰造极了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4A9E4F023C38FC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1460127002:1":{"text":"その後、文で風と氷を操る双剣がさらに進展を遂げたと知り、拙者はますます興味を持った。","source_cn":"但后来你写信说，你在操控风与冰的双剑上又取得了进展，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1BC5A0975775EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1460127003:0":{"text":"よもや、そのさらに上を行くとは……","source_cn":"没想到，你居然还能更进一步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x557F228097BCE286","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1460127004:1":{"text":"経験を積み重ね、学び、挑む……そして、導きときっかけがあれば、あなたも同じように成長できますよ。","source_cn":"积累，学习，挑战——以及一些引导和契机，你也能办得到，潘。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D6A0775C06F70B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1460127005:0":{"text":"今のあなたは、羽化を目前にした蝶のように、鮮やかな光をその身に秘めています。","source_cn":"我已经感觉到了，你就像是即将破茧的蝴蝶一样，酝酿着无比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8420AAF1C44D8114","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen